Subject: [PATCH] Arrange project deliverables by lab in lesson-plan order

Add deliverables/ with one folder per lab (Lab 1 to Lab 7) holding the SRS,
test plan and Jira backlog, architecture, design and validation spec update,
sprint videos and retrospectives, coverage report, and the system validation
report. Move reports/, sprint-demos/ and docs/ into it and update links.
